{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"Jigsaw starts talking when Malathor returns, thinking through their words slowly \"You all can probably tell I care deeply for Mike...\" They give him a small squeeze. \"So... So when the fey started burying a pacifier in front of the lair... In front of his home... I took it as a threat... And may have lost my composure.\" Jigsaw's speach quickens as they explain \"Rax was there and I knew he could handle things better than I, being fey and all, but he didn't understand the significance of it, so I tried to communicate it to him without the fey hearing but unfortunately the fey understood my abyssal... They know about Mike. They said they didn't care about him but I don't trust it. I'm worried I may have put Mike in danger.\" Jigsaw stiffens after they finally get it all out.","created_at":"2021-08-23T01:22:58.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879173845276327996","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"868223304513761301","content":"\"Ah yes, I do believe that was a Type 4 demon, a *Retriever*, created by trapping a Bebilith-soul in a *mechanical* body, otherwise known as barbed horrors or creepers of the Abyss. I have some manuals of demon-hunting, if you are interested...\" *Malathor turns to Jigsaw, and kneels down.*","created_at":"2021-08-23T01:26:21.707000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"879174695600152587","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
